// Simplified Chinese help translations.
" · [ ] size · Shift-[ ] hardness · 1–0 opacity · Escape cancel · Space to pan" = " · [ ] 调整大小 · Shift-[ ] 调整硬度 · 1–0 调整不透明度 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移";
" · [ ] size · Shift-[ ] hardness · 1–0 strength · Space to pan" = " · [ ] 调整大小 · Shift-[ ] 调整硬度 · 1–0 调整强度 · Space 平移";
", and EXR to keep light brighter than white" = "，也可使用 EXR 保留超出白色的亮度";
"Add layer mask (Option-click for a black mask)" = "添加图层蒙版（Option 点按可添加黑色蒙版）";
"Add layer mask revealing the selection (Option-click to hide it)" = "添加图层蒙版以显示选区（Option 点按可隐藏选区）";
"Adds film grain, strongest in the middle tones." = "添加胶片颗粒，在中间调最明显。";
"Adds green or magenta to the darkest tones." = "为最暗区域加入绿色或洋红色。";
"Adds or softens contrast along broader shapes." = "增强或柔化较大轮廓周围的对比度。";
"Adds or softens small detail." = "增强或柔化细小细节。";
"Adjusts the bright parts of the picture. Hold Option to see clipped highlights." = "调整图像亮部。按住 Option 可查看高光溢出。";
"Adjusts the dark parts of the picture. Hold Option to see clipped shadows." = "调整图像暗部。按住 Option 可查看阴影溢出。";
"Analyze the active layer only, or every visible layer as shown" = "仅分析当前图层，或按显示结果分析所有可见图层";
"Applies generic profile strength when camera metadata is not available." = "缺少相机元数据时，应用通用配置文件的校正强度。";
"Apply outside this range instead" = "改为应用于此范围之外";
"Auto balances the average color. Custom follows Temperature and Tint." = "自动模式平衡平均颜色；自定模式使用色温和色调设置。";
"Basic is quick; Advanced refines the mask against the layer's own detail, for hair and fur" = "基础模式速度较快；高级模式根据图层细节优化蒙版，适合头发和毛发";
"Blend the chosen color into the edges while keeping the center unchanged" = "将所选颜色混入边缘，保持中心不变";
"Blur only the colors, keeping the layer's outline and transparency as they are" = "仅模糊颜色，保持图层轮廓和透明度不变";
"Break the lines into beads where the picture is darker than this, blending into solid lines where it's brighter" = "将低于此亮度的线条断开为点状，在更亮处逐渐连成实线";
"Brightens or darkens the corners to counter lens falloff." = "提亮或压暗四角，补偿镜头造成的亮度衰减。";
"Brightens or darkens the whole picture, in stops of light. Hold Option to see clipped highlights." = "以曝光档数为单位提亮或压暗整张图像。按住 Option 可查看高光溢出。";
"Brightness added by this wheel." = "此色轮增加的亮度。";
"Brings back detail in bright areas the camera partly clipped" = "恢复相机部分过曝的亮部细节";
"CMYK writes a printer's inks through the profile in View › CMYK › Profile" = "CMYK 根据“视图 › CMYK › 配置文件”中的设置生成印刷油墨通道";
"Choose a CMYK ICC profile, such as the one your printer gave you" = "选择 CMYK ICC 配置文件，例如印刷方提供的配置文件";
"Choose a single key with optional modifiers." = "请选择单个按键，可搭配修饰键。";
"Chooses how bright an area must be to glow. Has no effect until Glow is raised." = "设置产生辉光所需的最低亮度。提高辉光强度后才会生效。";
"Chooses how strongly the calibration sliders below are applied. Version 6 is the current default." = "选择下方校准滑块的作用强度。当前默认为版本 6。";
"Clear the haze that leaves background showing through thin areas" = "去除半透明区域残留的背景雾色";
"Clears haze when raised, and adds haze when lowered." = "提高数值可去除薄雾，降低数值可增加薄雾。";
"Click a pixel that should be neutral." = "点按应为中性色的像素。";
"Click a purple or green fringe to set its hue range." = "点按紫色或绿色条边，以设置其色相范围。";
"Click a shortcut, then press its new key combination. Changes apply when you save." = "点按快捷键，然后按下新的组合键。保存后更改生效。";
"Click an object to select its outline · Tab for Wand · Shift add · Option subtract · Drag inside to move · ⌘-drag moves pixels · Delete clears · ⌘D deselect" = "点按对象以选择其轮廓 · Tab 切换魔棒 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · 在选区内拖动可移动 · ⌘ 拖动可移动像素 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择";
"Click corners · Click start, double-click or Enter to close · Delete removes corner · Escape cancel" = "逐个点按顶点 · 点按起点、连按两次或按 Enter 闭合 · Delete 移除顶点 · Escape 取消";
"Click or drag to move the view" = "点按或拖动以移动视图";
"Click the fringe on the layer. Click the eyedropper again to stop." = "点按图层上的条边取样，再次点按吸管可停止。";
"Click the image to add that color to the selection" = "点按图像，将该颜色添加到选区";
"Click the image to pick the color to select." = "点按图像，拾取要选择的颜色。";
"Click the image to select that color" = "点按图像以选择该颜色";
"Click the image to take that color out of the selection" = "点按图像，将该颜色从选区中移除";
"Click the original layer. Click the eyedropper again to stop." = "点按原始图层进行取样，再次点按吸管可停止。";
"Click the picture to save a color. Up to eight colors." = "点按图像以保存颜色，最多可保存八种。";
"Click to add a point. Drag to adjust." = "点按添加控制点，拖动进行调整。";
"Click to select similar colors · Tab for Object · Shift add · Option subtract · Drag inside to move · ⌘-drag moves pixels · Delete clears · ⌘D deselect" = "点按以选择相近颜色 · Tab 切换对象选择 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · 在选区内拖动可移动 · ⌘ 拖动可移动像素 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择";
"Click to select; double-click to edit; Option-drag to copy " = "点按以选择；连按两次以编辑；Option 拖动以复制";
"Click to zoom in · Option-click to zoom out · Drag right or left to zoom smoothly · Space to pan" = "点按以放大 · Option 点按以缩小 · 左右拖动可平滑缩放 · Space 平移";
"Color the result while keeping its tones, for a sepia or a cyanotype" = "为结果着色并保留明暗层次，可制作棕褐色或蓝晒效果";
"Compositor will convert these Photoshop features. Nothing is applied until you continue." = "Compositor 将转换以下 Photoshop 功能。继续后才会应用转换。";
"Controls how much the three tonal wheels overlap." = "控制三个明暗色轮之间的重叠程度。";
"Controls how strong the sharpening is." = "控制锐化强度。";
"Copy from the active layer only, or from every visible layer as shown" = "仅从当前图层复制，或按显示结果从所有可见图层复制";
"Create a canvas or import an image." = "新建画布或导入图像。";
"Crops empty edges after the transform and fits the result back into the frame." = "裁去变换后产生的空白边缘，再将结果适配到画框内。";
"Darkens or lightens the edges. The center does not change." = "调暗或调亮边缘，中心保持不变。";
"Darker or lighter before the lines are drawn" = "在绘制线条前调暗或调亮图像";
"Diffusion is soft and wide, Bloom is tighter, and Halation is a red fringe." = "扩散效果柔和且范围较广，辉光更集中，光晕则产生红色边缘。";
"Dims the picture outside this color's range. It is not kept when you press OK." = "调暗此颜色范围之外的图像，方便查看。按“好”后不会保留该预览效果。";
"Drag a color in the picture. Nearby color families move together." = "在图像中的某种颜色上拖动，相近色系会一起调整。";
"Drag a point. Click to add one. Double-click a point to remove it." = "拖动控制点进行调整。点按可添加控制点，连按两次控制点可移除。";
"Drag a rectangle · Shift add · Option subtract · Shift again mid-drag square · Drag inside to move · ⌘-drag moves pixels · Delete clears · ⌘D deselect" = "拖出矩形选区 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · 拖动中再按 Shift 约束为正方形 · 在选区内拖动可移动 · ⌘ 拖动可移动像素 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择";
"Drag a text box · Click text to edit · Drag box handles to resize · ⌘Return finish · Escape cancel" = "拖出文本框 · 点按文字以编辑 · 拖动文本框控制点可调整大小 · ⌘Return 完成 · Escape 取消";
"Drag an ellipse · Shift add · Option subtract · Shift again mid-drag circle · Drag inside to move · Delete clears · ⌘D deselect" = "拖出椭圆选区 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · 拖动中再按 Shift 约束为圆形 · 在选区内拖动可移动 · Delete 清除 · ⌘D 取消选择";
"Drag inside the wheel. Angle sets hue, distance sets saturation." = "在色轮内拖动。角度决定色相，距中心的距离决定饱和度。";
"Drag on the layer to place a guide. Draw at least two lines." = "在图层上拖动以放置参考线，请至少绘制两条。";
"Drag on the picture to move the curve for the tone under the pointer." = "在图像上拖动，调整指针下方色调对应的曲线位置。";
"Drag or scroll to move around; double-click switches between Fit and 100%" = "拖动或滚动以移动视图；连按两次可在适合窗口和 100% 之间切换";
"Drag over blemishes to heal · [ ] size · Shift-[ ] hardness · Escape cancel · Space to pan" = "拖过瑕疵以修复 · [ ] 调整大小 · Shift-[ ] 调整硬度 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移";
"Drag to crop · Enter apply · Escape cancel · Space to pan" = "拖动以裁剪 · Enter 应用 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移";
"Drag to draw a shape on a new layer · Shift %@ · Option from center · Shift-U or Tab for the next shape · Escape cancel · Space to pan" = "拖动以在新图层上绘制形状 · Shift 约束为%@ · Option 从中心绘制 · Shift-U 或 Tab 切换下一种形状 · Escape 取消 · Space 平移";
"Drag to draw · Drag ends to adjust · Shift 45° · 1–0 opacity · Enter apply · Escape cancel" = "拖动以绘制 · 拖动端点以调整 · Shift 约束为 45° · 1–0 调整不透明度 · Enter 应用 · Escape 取消";
"Drag to move · Handles to resize · Circle to rotate · 1–0 layer opacity · Space to pan" = "拖动以移动 · 拖动控制点调整大小 · 拖动圆形控制点旋转 · 1–0 调整图层不透明度 · Space 平移";
"Drag to select · Drag inside to move · Shift add · Option subtract · Delete clears · ⌥⌫/⌘⌫ fill · ⌘D deselect" = "拖动以创建选区 · 在选区内拖动可移动 · Shift 添加 · Option 减去 · Delete 清除 · ⌥⌫/⌘⌫ 填充 · ⌘D 取消选择";
"Drag to set hue and saturation. Double-click to reset this wheel." = "拖动以设置色相和饱和度，连按两次可重置此色轮。";
"Drag up or down to lift or lower those tones. Drag a divider along the bottom to change which tones each region covers." = "上下拖动以提亮或压暗对应色调。沿底部拖动分隔点可调整各区域覆盖的明暗范围。";
"Draw each chunky pixel as a solid square, or as a round dot like a dot-matrix screen" = "将每个像素块绘制为实心方块，或点阵屏幕式的圆点";
"Draw no line where the picture is darker than this, leaving the screen dark" = "不在低于此亮度的区域绘制线条，保留暗屏效果";
"Draw the marks for the light tones on the dark color, like a glowing screen" = "在深色背景上绘制亮部标记，形成发光屏幕效果";
"Draw two or more lines on the preview that should be level or vertical." = "在预览上绘制至少两条应当水平或垂直的线。";
"Emphasizes fine texture over broader edges." = "相比大轮廓边缘，更强调细微纹理。";
"End of the hue range, in degrees." = "色相范围的终点，以度为单位。";
"Fade the edge of the selection by this many pixels" = "按指定像素数羽化选区边缘";
"Fill the selection using surrounding pixels from this layer." = "使用此图层中选区周围的像素填充选区。";
"Font face, including bold and italic variants" = "字体样式，包括粗体和斜体等变体";
"HDR layer: keeps light brighter than white, shown as white" = "HDR 图层：保留超出白色的亮度，预览中显示为白色";
"HSL lists every color. Color edits one family. Point Color adjusts a color you pick." = "HSL 列出所有颜色；颜色模式编辑单个色系；点颜色模式调整您拾取的颜色。";
"Height in pixels; the width follows, keeping the proportions" = "高度，以像素为单位；宽度会同步调整以保持比例";
"Hide the background behind a layer mask, keeping the foreground subjects. The pixels stay, so the background can be painted back at any time." = "通过图层蒙版隐藏背景，保留前景主体。原始像素会保留，可随时在蒙版上涂画以恢复背景。";
"Highlight Priority protects bright edges. Color Priority also reduces color. Paint Overlay covers the edges evenly." = "高光优先保护明亮边缘；颜色优先还会减淡颜色；绘制叠加则均匀覆盖边缘。";
"Hold Shift to add or Option to subtract for one outline" = "绘制当前轮廓时，按住 Shift 添加到选区，或按住 Option 从选区减去";
"How bright the lines are where the picture is black, so they show even over black" = "设置纯黑区域中的线条亮度，使线条在黑色上也能显示";
"How far a color may be from the picked ones and still be selected" = "设置仍会被选中的颜色与已拾取颜色之间的最大差异";
"How far apart the screen's lines are" = "屏幕线条之间的间距";
"How far each color channel (0–255) can differ from the clicked color and still be selected" = "每个颜色通道（0–255）与点按颜色的允许差异，范围内的像素仍会被选中";
"How far from each edge the sharpening reaches, in pixels." = "锐化从各个边缘向外作用的距离，以像素为单位。";
"How far in brightness the adjustment reaches." = "调整所覆盖的亮度范围。";
"How far in hue the adjustment reaches." = "调整所覆盖的色相范围。";
"How far in saturation the adjustment reaches." = "调整所覆盖的饱和度范围。";
"How far the blur softens, in pixels" = "模糊柔化的范围，以像素为单位";
"How far the brightness is smoothed before it displaces the lines, from sharp ridges to rounded hills" = "在线条位移前平滑亮度的范围，使尖锐起伏变得圆润";
"How much of each pixel's error spreads to its neighbors. Less gives flatter areas" = "每个像素的误差向相邻像素扩散的程度；数值越低，色块越平整";
"How much of the gap a bright line fills; dimmer parts draw it thinner" = "亮线占线间距的比例；较暗部分的线条会更细";
"How much of the profile distortion correction is applied." = "配置文件中畸变校正的应用程度。";
"How much of the profile vignetting correction is applied." = "配置文件中暗角校正的应用程度。";
"How much the curve also changes color strength. Zero matches Photoshop; lower keeps it to brightness, higher adds more color." = "设置曲线对颜色浓度的影响。0 与 Photoshop 一致；较低值更侧重亮度，较高值增加颜色浓度。";
"Hue and saturation of this wheel." = "此色轮的色相和饱和度。";
"Hue around the wheel, saturation outward from the center. Control-click to show the histogram." = "色轮周向表示色相，从中心向外表示饱和度。Control 点按可显示直方图。";
"Hue range where green defringe runs." = "去绿边的色相范围。";
"Hue range where purple defringe runs." = "去紫边的色相范围。";
"Hue shifts the color, Saturation its strength, and Luminance its brightness." = "色相改变颜色，饱和度改变颜色浓度，明亮度改变颜色明暗。";
"Import an image or add a blank layer." = "导入图像或添加空白图层。";
"Input and output of the selected curve point." = "所选曲线控制点的输入值和输出值。";
"Keep the 16-bit layers' full precision, in a file about twice the size" = "保留 16 位图层的完整精度，文件大小约为原来的两倍";
"Keep the source moving with the brush between strokes; off starts every stroke at the source point" = "在不同笔画间保持来源随画笔移动；关闭后，每笔都从来源点重新开始";
"Keeps local contrast after luminance smoothing." = "平滑亮度后保留局部对比度。";
"Keeps this point fixed. Artwork is not scaled; cropped content remains outside the canvas." = "保持此点固定。图像不会缩放；裁去的内容仍保留在画布外。";
"Lift the lines where the picture is bright, or lower them when negative, so they swell into its shapes" = "在图像亮处抬高线条，负值则降低线条，使线条随图像形状起伏";
"Lifts or lowers the brightest tones." = "提亮或压暗最亮色调。";
"Lifts or lowers the dark tones." = "提亮或压暗暗调。";
"Lifts or lowers the darkest tones." = "提亮或压暗最暗色调。";
"Lifts or lowers the light tones." = "提亮或压暗亮调。";
"Light blooming around the lines, like a CRT's phosphors" = "在线条周围产生辉光，模拟 CRT 荧光粉效果";
"Limits sharpening to stronger edges. Hold Option to see the mask." = "仅锐化较明显的边缘。按住 Option 可查看蒙版。";
"Line height, baseline to baseline. Empty or 0 is Auto: 120% of the font size." = "相邻文字基线之间的行高。留空或设为 0 时自动使用字号的 120%。";
"Linear histogram with automatic vertical scaling. Tall spikes may extend beyond the graph; all tones from 0 to 255 remain included." = "线性直方图，纵轴自动缩放。较高的峰值可能超出图表，但仍包含 0 至 255 的全部色阶。";
"Linear runs along the line; Radial spreads out from the start point" = "线性渐变沿线条方向展开；径向渐变从起点向外扩散";
"Link layer and mask so they move together" = "链接图层与蒙版，使其一起移动";
"Liquify pushes pixels · Blur softens · Smudge drags color along" = "液化推动像素 · 模糊柔化图像 · 涂抹拖动颜色";
"Lock aspect ratio. Hold Shift while dragging a handle to turn it the other way." = "锁定纵横比。拖动控制点时按住 Shift 可临时反转此设置。";
"Make each dithered pixel this many pixels across, for a chunky old-screen look" = "设置每个抖色像素块的宽度，形成老式屏幕的大颗粒效果";
"Make the lines waver sideways down the screen, like a CRT losing sync" = "让线条沿屏幕纵向左右摇摆，模拟 CRT 失去同步的效果";
"Makes light and dark tones more or less different, mostly around the middle." = "主要在中间调区域增强或减弱明暗差异。";
"Makes the color smoothing softer or tighter." = "使颜色平滑效果更柔和或更集中。";
"Makes the grain coarser or finer." = "使颗粒更粗或更细。";
"Makes the grain smoother or more uneven." = "使颗粒更平滑或更不均匀。";
"Makes the picked color lighter or darker." = "提亮或压暗已拾取的颜色。";
"Makes the picked color stronger or quieter." = "增强或减弱已拾取颜色的饱和度。";
"Makes the selected color family lighter or darker." = "提亮或压暗所选色系。";
"Makes the selected color family stronger or quieter." = "增强或减弱所选色系的饱和度。";
"Makes the vignette rounder or more square." = "使暗角形状更圆或更方。";
"Match the clicked pixel, or the average of the pixels around it" = "匹配点按的像素，或其周围像素的平均颜色";
"More ink (darker) or less before dithering" = "在抖色前增加墨量以加深，或减少墨量以提亮";
"Move the red and blue apart, for colored fringes on the lines" = "分离红色和蓝色，在线条边缘产生彩色条边";
"Moves the picture left or right." = "向左或向右移动图像。";
"Moves the picture up or down." = "向上或向下移动图像。";
"Moves the vignette correction inward or outward." = "向内或向外移动暗角校正范围。";
"New canvas (⌘N) · Drop images here for new tabs" = "新建画布（⌘N）· 将图像拖到此处以创建新标签页";
"No lens metadata on this layer. Profile sliders set generic correction strength." = "此图层没有镜头元数据。配置文件滑块将调整通用校正强度。";
"No tool selected · Press a tool's key to pick one · Space to pan" = "尚未选择工具 · 按工具快捷键进行选择 · Space 平移";
"Off leaves the picture as it is. Guided straightens from lines you draw on the picture." = "关闭时保持图像原样；引导模式根据您在图像上绘制的线条校正透视。";
"Only print dimensions and resolution change. Pixels stay unchanged." = "仅更改打印尺寸和分辨率，像素保持不变。";
"Option temporarily selects the eyedropper in painting tools. Shift constrains shapes/movement or adds to a selection; Option subtracts from selections or draws from center. Command-drag moves selected pixels; Command-Option-drag copies them. Option-drag duplicates layers/folders/effects; Option-click at a layer boundary toggles clipping. Command-click a thumbnail loads its selection. Control bypasses snapping. Right-drag adjusts brush size. Modifier-and-mouse gestures are fixed." = "使用绘画工具时，按住 Option 可临时切换为吸管。Shift 用于约束形状和移动方向，或添加到选区；Option 用于从选区减去，或从中心绘制。Command 拖动可移动所选像素，Command-Option 拖动可复制所选像素。Option 拖动可复制图层、文件夹和效果；Option 点按图层边界可切换剪贴关系。Command 点按缩略图可载入对应选区。Control 可暂时忽略吸附。按住鼠标右键拖动可调整画笔大小。修饰键与鼠标组合手势不可更改。";
"Option-click to set the source" = "Option 点按以设置来源";
"Option-click to set the source · Drag to clone · [ ] size · Shift-[ ] hardness · 1–0 opacity · Space to pan" = "Option 点按设置来源 · 拖动以仿制 · [ ] 调整大小 · Shift-[ ] 调整硬度 · 1–0 调整不透明度 · Space 平移";
"Paint with the foreground color (B), or erase pixels away (E)" = "使用前景色绘画（B），或擦除像素（E）";
"Parametric lifts tonal regions. Point places anchors on the curve." = "参数曲线调整不同明暗区域；点曲线通过曲线上的锚点进行调整。";
"Perspective allows stronger keystone. Rectilinear keeps the warp gentler." = "透视模式允许更强的梯形校正；直线模式的变形更柔和。";
"Positive straightens lines that bow outward (barrel); negative, lines that bow inward (pincushion)." = "正值校正向外弯曲的线条（桶形畸变），负值校正向内弯曲的线条（枕形畸变）。";
"Positive values tighten the detected mask inward; negative values expand it outward" = "正值向内收缩检测到的蒙版，负值向外扩展";
"Preserves colored edges while color noise is reduced." = "减少颜色噪点时保留彩色边缘。";
"Preserves fine texture while luminance noise is reduced." = "减少亮度噪点时保留细微纹理。";
"Preset sizes for screens and common formats" = "屏幕及常见格式的预设尺寸";
"Press 1–9 for 10–90%, 0 for 100%" = "按 1–9 设置为 10–90%，按 0 设置为 100%";
"Press L to switch between Freehand and Polygonal" = "按 L 在自由套索与多边形套索之间切换";
"Press M to switch between Rectangle and Ellipse" = "按 M 在矩形与椭圆之间切换";
"Press Tab to switch between Wand and Object" = "按 Tab 在魔棒与对象选择之间切换";
"Protect bright areas near the edge" = "保护边缘附近的亮部";
"Protects bright pixels while a dark vignette is applied. Used by Highlight Priority." = "应用暗角时保护明亮像素，仅用于高光优先模式。";
"Pull the mask onto the image's own edges, which recovers hair and fur" = "使蒙版贴合图像边缘，恢复头发和毛发细节";
"Pulls red and blue fringes apart toward the center to reduce color edging." = "朝中心方向分别调整红色和蓝色条边，减少边缘色差。";
"Put each pixel's brightness back afterwards, so only the color moves" = "调整后恢复每个像素的亮度，仅改变颜色";
"RGB changes brightness. Red, green, and blue also shift the color." = "RGB 调整亮度；红、绿、蓝通道还会改变颜色。";
"Read colors from the active layer only, or from every visible layer as shown" = "仅从当前图层取样，或按显示结果从所有可见图层取样";
"Reading the file to see what needs converting." = "正在读取文件，检查需要转换的内容。";
"Red, green, and blue of the pixel under the pointer." = "指针下方像素的红、绿、蓝数值。";
"Removes the lens's distortion and vignetting" = "校正镜头畸变和暗角";
"Replaces this curve with a straight line or a contrast curve." = "将此曲线替换为直线或对比度曲线。";
"Resizes layer pixels and applies existing transforms. Undo restores the originals." = "调整图层像素大小并应用已有变换。撤销可恢复原始内容。";
"Resolution: 72 for screens, 300 for print. Click to switch." = "分辨率：屏幕使用 72，印刷使用 300。点按可切换。";
"Rotates the picture around its center." = "围绕中心旋转图像。";
"Round the rectangle's corners by this many pixels; 0 keeps them square" = "设置矩形圆角的像素半径；0 表示直角";
"Scale the export: the document stays as it is" = "缩放导出结果，文稿保持原样";
"Scale width and height together, about the center" = "以中心为基准，同时缩放宽度和高度";
"Select everything except those colors, such as all but a green screen" = "选择这些颜色之外的所有内容，例如绿幕以外的区域";
"Select layer mask; Option-click to view it alone; Shift-click to enable/disable; Cmd-click to select its black areas (Cmd-Shift adds, Cmd-Option subtracts)" = "选择图层蒙版；Option 点按可单独查看；Shift 点按可启用或停用；Cmd 点按可选择黑色区域（Cmd-Shift 添加，Cmd-Option 减去）";
"Select layer; Cmd-click to select its pixels (Cmd-Shift adds, Cmd-Option subtracts)" = "选择图层；Cmd 点按可选择其像素（Cmd-Shift 添加，Cmd-Option 减去）";
"Select layers by clicking the canvas. Hold Command to turn it the other way while you click." = "点按画布以选择图层。按住 Command 点按可临时反转此设置。";
"Select only similar pixels connected to the one you click; off selects them everywhere" = "仅选择与点按位置相连的相似像素；关闭后选择所有位置的相似像素";
"Sets how far the glow reaches. Has no effect until Glow is raised." = "设置辉光扩散范围。提高辉光强度后才会生效。";
"Sets the brightest point. Hold Option to see clipped highlights." = "设置最亮点。按住 Option 可查看高光溢出。";
"Sets the darkest point. Hold Option to see clipped shadows." = "设置最暗点。按住 Option 可查看阴影溢出。";
"Sets where the vignette begins, from the center outward." = "设置暗角从中心向外开始的位置。";
"Shapes fill with the foreground color; click to change it" = "形状使用前景色填充；点按可更改颜色";
"Shift-U (or Tab) steps through Rectangle, Ellipse and Line" = "按 Shift-U（或 Tab）依次切换矩形、椭圆和直线";
"Shift-click adds a color, Option-click takes one away." = "Shift 点按添加颜色，Option 点按移除颜色。";
"Shifts how blue is interpreted." = "调整蓝色原色的色相。";
"Shifts how green is interpreted." = "调整绿色原色的色相。";
"Shifts how red is interpreted." = "调整红色原色的色相。";
"Shifts the glow from cool to warm. Halation stays red. Has no effect until Glow is raised." = "将辉光从冷色调整为暖色；光晕保持红色。提高辉光强度后才会生效。";
"Shifts the picked color around the color wheel." = "沿色轮调整已拾取颜色的色相。";
"Shifts the picture from blue to yellow." = "在蓝色与黄色之间调整图像。";
"Shifts the picture from green to mauve." = "在绿色与紫红色之间调整图像。";
"Shifts the selected color family around the wheel." = "沿色轮调整所选色系的色相。";
"Shifts the wheels toward shadows or highlights." = "将色轮作用范围偏向阴影或高光。";
"Show clipped highlights in red on the preview." = "在预览中用红色标记溢出的高光。";
"Show clipped shadows in blue on the preview." = "在预览中用蓝色标记溢出的阴影。";
"Show the document's own colors again" = "重新显示文稿本身的颜色";
"Show the image again (or Option-click the mask thumbnail)" = "重新显示图像（也可 Option 点按蒙版缩略图）";
"Show the transform box and handles (⌘H). When hidden, drag anywhere to move the layer." = "显示变换框和控制点（⌘H）。隐藏时，可在任意位置拖动以移动图层。";
"Shrink the mask to drop the rim of background color around the subject, or grow it" = "收缩蒙版以去除主体周围残留的背景色边缘，也可向外扩展";
"Smooth selection edges; turn off for hard pixel edges" = "平滑选区边缘；关闭后保留硬像素边缘";
"Smooth the detected object outline; turn off for the raw pixel mask" = "平滑检测到的对象轮廓；关闭后使用原始像素蒙版";
"Smooths grain and noise in brightness." = "平滑亮度中的颗粒和噪点。";
"Smooths grain, at the cost of fine detail" = "平滑颗粒，但会损失部分细节";
"Softens the edge of the vignette." = "柔化暗角边缘。";
"Spreads a glow from the bright areas." = "从亮部向外扩散辉光。";
"Start of the hue range, in degrees." = "色相范围的起点，以度为单位。";
"Start see-through, or with a white or black Background layer. Click to switch." = "以透明画布，或白色、黑色背景图层开始。点按可切换。";
"Stop marking colors the profile can't print" = "停止标记配置文件无法打印的颜色";
"Straightens barrel or pincushion bending." = "校正桶形或枕形畸变。";
"Straightens horizontal lines toward the center." = "朝中心方向校直水平线条。";
"Straightens vertical lines toward the center." = "朝中心方向校直垂直线条。";
"Strengthens or weakens every color by the same amount." = "以相同幅度增强或减弱所有颜色。";
"Strengthens or weakens the blue primary." = "增强或减弱蓝色原色。";
"Strengthens or weakens the green primary." = "增强或减弱绿色原色。";
"Strengthens or weakens the red primary." = "增强或减弱红色原色。";
"Strengthens quiet colors more than colors that are already strong, and protects skin tones." = "优先增强较淡的颜色，减少对浓艳颜色的影响，并保护肤色。";
"Stretches width relative to height." = "相对于高度拉伸宽度。";
"Targeted adjustment: drag on the image to change that color's saturation, or its hue with Command held" = "目标调整：在图像上拖动以改变该颜色的饱和度，按住 Command 拖动可改变色相";
"Text fields keep standard macOS editing keys. Dialogs share the Apply/Cancel assignments above. Numeric fields use Up/Down, with Shift for larger steps. Standard macOS commands include ⌘Q to quit and ⌃⌘F for full screen. The shortcut editor itself always uses Return to save and Esc to cancel when not recording." = "文本框保留 macOS 标准编辑快捷键。对话框共用上方设置的“应用”和“取消”快捷键。数值输入框使用 Up/Down 调整，搭配 Shift 可增大步长。macOS 标准快捷键包括 ⌘Q 退出和 ⌃⌘F 全屏。快捷键编辑器在未录入按键时，始终使用 Return 保存、Esc 取消。";
"Text-editing shortcuts need Command, Option, or Control so they do not replace normal typing." = "文字编辑快捷键须搭配 Command、Option 或 Control，以免影响正常输入。";
"The brush trails the pointer on a string this long, so a shaky hand still draws a smooth line" = "画笔以指定长度的牵引线跟随指针，减轻手抖并画出平滑线条";
"The characters to draw with, in any order: each spot gets the one whose ink best matches its tone" = "用于绘制的字符，顺序不限；每个位置会选用笔画覆盖率最符合其明暗的字符";
"The height of each line of characters" = "每行字符的高度";
"Three-Way shows shadows, midtones, and highlights. The other choices show one wheel." = "三向模式同时显示阴影、中间调和高光色轮；其他选项仅显示单个色轮。";
"Tones from black on the left to white on the right: blacks, shadows, midtones, highlights, whites. Control-click to show the vectorscope." = "色调从左侧的黑到右侧的白依次为：黑色、阴影、中间调、高光、白色。Control 点按可显示矢量示波器。";
"Tones per channel: 2 is pure black and white" = "每个通道的色阶数：2 表示纯黑白";
"Units: pixels, inches, centimeters or millimeters. Click to switch." = "单位：像素、英寸、厘米或毫米。点按可切换。";
"Unlink layer and mask to move or transform them separately" = "取消图层与蒙版的链接，以便分别移动或变换";
"Use a CMYK ICC profile, such as the one your printer gave you" = "使用 CMYK ICC 配置文件，例如印刷方提供的配置文件";
"Weakens green fringes inside the green hue range." = "减弱绿色色相范围内的绿色条边。";
"Weakens purple fringes inside the purple hue range." = "减弱紫色色相范围内的紫色条边。";
"Width in pixels; the height follows, keeping the proportions" = "宽度，以像素为单位；高度会同步调整以保持比例";
"Zoom percentage (0.1–3200%). Press Return to apply." = "缩放比例（0.1–3200%）。按 Return 应用。";
"Zooms the transformed picture within the frame." = "在画框内缩放变换后的图像。";
